<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":3,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T11:48:13.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":38,"name":"May"},"cards":[{"id":51310,"front":"<p>The government is expected to _______ a state of emergency due to the escalating crisis. <em>(kihirdet \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>She decided to _______ her love for him openly, despite the potential consequences. <em>(kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ vall)<\/em><\/p><p>All goods brought into the country must be properly _______ at customs. <em>(bev\u00e1mol \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist chose to _______ his new exhibition with a bold and provocative statement. <em>(megnyit \/ bevezet)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kijelent \/ kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ bejelent<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhallgat \/ titkol \/ tagad<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ war = h\u00e1bor\u00fat \u00fczen\/kihirdet (pl. Nations often _______ war after diplomatic efforts fail.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a dividend = osztal\u00e9kot fizet\/kihirdet (pl. The company decided to _______ a dividend to its shareholders.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ one&#039;s intentions = kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edtja sz\u00e1nd\u00e9kait (pl. It&#039;s important to _______ your intentions clearly in negotiations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ bankruptcy = cs\u0151d\u00f6t jelent (pl. Many businesses were forced to _______ bankruptcy during the recession.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>declare<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>declarative<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>declaration<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>declare<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: declare war \/ declare independence \/ declare a winner \/ declare a state of emergency<\/span><\/p><p>similar: announce \/ proclaim \/ state \/ assert<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: conceal \/ hide \/ deny<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"declare\ndeclarative\ndeclaration","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-28T09:03:40+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-21T16:24:00+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-27T11:00:09+00:00"},{"id":51295,"front":"<p>The tall grass began to _______ gently in the evening breeze. <em>(ringat\u00f3zik \/ lengedezik)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the strong arguments, he refused to _______ from his original position. <em>(elt\u00e9r \/ enged)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician&#039;s charismatic speech was designed to _______ public opinion. <em>(befoly\u00e1sol \/ ir\u00e1ny\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The ship began to _______ dangerously in the rough seas, making many passengers seasick. <em>(ingadozik \/ d\u00fcl\u00f6ng\u00e9l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ingat \/ befoly\u00e1sol \/ ringat\u00f3zik<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): stabiliz\u00e1l \/ megszil\u00e1rd\u00edt \/ ellen\u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ public opinion = befoly\u00e1solja a k\u00f6zv\u00e9lem\u00e9nyt (pl. His powerful speech began to _______ public opinion in his favor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ back and forth = ide-oda ringat\u00f3zik (pl. The hammock began to _______ back and forth in the gentle wind.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 under the _______ of = valaki\/valami befoly\u00e1sa alatt (pl. The decision was made under the strong _______ of the CEO.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ with the music = ringat\u00f3zik a zene \u00fctem\u00e9re (pl. She began to _______ with the music, lost in the rhythm.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sway public opinion \/ sway back and forth \/ hold sway \/ sway from<\/span><\/p><p>similar: influence \/ oscillate \/ waver \/ dominate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stabilize \/ remain firm \/ resist<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-27","due_at":"2026-05-27T07:49:20+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-27T07:38:13+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","reviewed_on":"2026-05-27"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-29T07:49:55+00:00"},{"id":51324,"front":"<p>After the divorce, the parents fought bitterly over the legal _______ of their children. <em>(gyermekfel\u00fcgyelet \/ fel\u00fcgyeleti jog)<\/em><\/p><p>The suspect was taken into police _______ for questioning regarding the robbery. <em>(\u0151rizet \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manuscript is kept under strict _______ in the museum&#039;s secure archives. <em>(\u0151rz\u00e9s \/ fel\u00fcgyelet)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge awarded sole _______ of the estate to the eldest son. <em>(gondnoks\u00e1g \/ vagyonkezel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u0151rizet \/ fel\u00fcgyelet \/ gondnoks\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabads\u00e1g \/ elenged\u00e9s \/ f\u00fcggetlens\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in _______ = \u0151rizetben (pl. He was taken in _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 legal _______ = jogi fel\u00fcgyelet (pl. The court granted legal _______ of the child to the mother.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 sole _______ = kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lagos fel\u00fcgyelet\/gondnoks\u00e1g (pl. She was awarded sole _______ of the children.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take into _______ = \u0151rizetbe vesz (pl. The police took the suspect into _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 award _______ = fel\u00fcgyeletet\/gondnoks\u00e1got \u00edt\u00e9l (pl. The judge will award _______ next week.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: child custody \/ police custody \/ legal custody \/ sole custody<\/span><\/p><p>similar: guardianship \/ detention \/ care \/ supervision<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: freedom \/ release \/ liberty<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"custody","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-16","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T07:50:46+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-22T04:23:41+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-16","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-29T15:26:31+00:00"},{"id":51329,"front":"<p>The archaeologists carefully unearthed an ancient _______ from the Roman ruins. <em>(r\u00e9g\u00e9szeti lelet \/ emberi alkot\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>Many museums display a wide range of historical _______, showcasing human ingenuity across centuries. <em>(t\u00e1rgyi eml\u00e9k \/ m\u0171t\u00e1rgy)<\/em><\/p><p>Modern technology can sometimes create digital _______ that mimic real-world objects, though they lack physical substance. <em>(mesters\u00e9ges k\u00e9pz\u0151dm\u00e9ny \/ digit\u00e1lis alkot\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>Even a simple stone tool found in a prehistoric cave is considered a valuable _______ for understanding early human life. <em>(ember alkotta t\u00e1rgy \/ kult\u00fart\u00e1rgy)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">m\u0171t\u00e1rgy \/ lelet \/ ember alkotta t\u00e1rgy<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): term\u00e9szeti k\u00e9pz\u0151dm\u00e9ny \/ term\u00e9szetes dolog \/ term\u00e9szetes jelens\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ancient _______ = \u0151si m\u0171t\u00e1rgy (pl. They discovered an ancient _______ in the tomb.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 historical _______ = t\u00f6rt\u00e9nelmi m\u0171t\u00e1rgy (pl. The museum houses many historical _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cultural _______ = kultur\u00e1lis m\u0171t\u00e1rgy (pl. The exhibition featured various cultural _______ from the region.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 digital _______ = digit\u00e1lis m\u0171t\u00e1rgy (pl. A digital _______ can be a complex piece of software.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>artifact<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>artifact<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: ancient artifact \/ historical artifact \/ cultural artifact \/ digital artifact<\/span><\/p><p>similar: relic \/ object \/ item \/ find<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: natural object \/ natural formation \/ natural phenomenon<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"artifact","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-28T07:49:45+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-21T23:31:12+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-19","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-29T09:02:02+00:00"},{"id":51290,"front":"<p>I need to buy new computer _______ for my gaming PC, especially a better graphics card. <em>(sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p alkatr\u00e9szek \/ fizikai eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k)<\/em><\/p><p>The company specializes in developing innovative software solutions, but they also provide the necessary _______ infrastructure. <em>(fizikai berendez\u00e9sek \/ eszk\u00f6zpark)<\/em><\/p><p>Before installing the operating system, ensure all the _______ components are correctly connected and recognized. <em>(fizikai r\u00e9szegys\u00e9gek \/ g\u00e9pi elemek)<\/em><\/p><p>The museum exhibit showcased the evolution of early computing _______, from vacuum tubes to integrated circuits. <em>(g\u00e9pi eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k \/ fizikai komponensek)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">hardver \/ vas \/ g\u00e9pi berendez\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szoftver \/ program \/ alkalmaz\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 computer _______ = sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p hardver (pl. Upgrading your computer _______ can significantly improve performance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 network _______ = h\u00e1l\u00f3zati hardver (pl. We need to install new network _______ to support the increased traffic.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 install _______ = hardvert telep\u00edt (pl. It&#039;s easy to install new _______ if you follow the instructions.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ components = hardver komponensek (pl. All the _______ components must be compatible for the system to work.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hardware<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>hardware<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: computer hardware \/ network hardware \/ hardware components \/ hardware failure<\/span><\/p><p>similar: equipment \/ machinery \/ components \/ gear<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: software \/ firmware \/ applications<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":8,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20","due_at":"2026-05-28T10:56:55+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-17T11:45:52+00:00","interval":4,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-09","reviewed_on":"2026-05-13"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"10 nap","good":"16 nap","easy":"21 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-30T19:54:44+00:00"},{"id":51296,"front":"<p>I accidentally stepped on a nail and got a _______ in my tire. <em>(defekt \/ lyuk)<\/em><\/p><p>The sharp thorn managed to _______ the skin, causing a small bleed. <em>(kilyukaszt \/ \u00e1tsz\u00far)<\/em><\/p><p>During the medical procedure, a fine needle was used to _______ the membrane. <em>(perfor\u00e1l \/ \u00e1thatol)<\/em><\/p><p>The sudden drop in sales threatened to _______ the company&#039;s financial stability. <em>(megingat \/ al\u00e1\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kilyukaszt \/ defekt \/ lyuk<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): meger\u0151s\u00edt \/ megv\u00e9d \/ bet\u00f6m<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 get a _______ = defektet kap (pl. I got a _______ on the way to work.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a tire = kilyukaszt egy gumit (pl. He accidentally _______ a tire on a sharp rock.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ wound = sz\u00fart seb (pl. The doctor treated the small _______ wound.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a hole = lyukat \u00fct (pl. The sharp object can _______ a hole in the material.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>puncture<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>puncture<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>puncture<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: tire puncture \/ puncture wound \/ puncture repair \/ puncture proof<\/span><\/p><p>similar: perforate \/ pierce \/ stab \/ hole<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: seal \/ mend \/ repair<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-11","review