take in a meal \/ partake of food \/ partake in an activity \/ partake in a discussion<\/span><\/p><p>similar: participate \/ share \/ engage \/ take part<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abstain \/ forgo \/ refrain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"partake","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-25","due_at":"2026-05-27T11:00:46+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-22T04:17:05+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-28T20:27:36+00:00"},{"id":51321,"front":"<p>For a healthy breakfast, I often have a bowl of _______ with milk and fruit. <em>(zabk\u00e1sa \/ reggeli gabonapehely)<\/em><\/p><p>The farmer cultivated a large field of _______ to feed his livestock during the winter months. <em>(zab \/ takarm\u00e1nyn\u00f6v\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>Research suggests that regular consumption of _______ can help lower cholesterol levels due to its high fiber content. <em>(zabpehely \/ gabonaf\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>The old mill used to grind various grains, including wheat and _______, into flour. <em>(zab \/ \u0151r\u00f6lt gabona)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">zab \/ zabpehely \/ zabk\u00e1sa<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): b\u00faza \/ rizs \/ kukorica<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 rolled _______ = hengerelt zabpehely (pl. She made cookies with rolled _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 steel-cut _______ = v\u00e1gott zabpehely (pl. Steel-cut _______ take longer to cook but have a chewier texture.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ porridge = zabk\u00e1sa (pl. A warm bowl of _______ porridge is perfect on a cold morning.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 wild _______ = vadzab (pl. Wild _______ can be found growing in many fields.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: oats and honey \/ oats for breakfast \/ oats in baking \/ oats for horses<\/span><\/p><p>similar: oatmeal \/ porridge \/ groats \/ cereals<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: wheat \/ rice \/ corn<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"oats","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-18","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-28T09:02:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-21T20:04:02+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-18","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-01T15:25:49+00:00"},{"id":51301,"front":"<p>The meeting will be postponed _______ a new venue can be secured. <em>(am\u00edg \/ addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>We will continue to monitor the situation _______ we receive further instructions. <em>(mindaddig, am\u00edg \/ eg\u00e9szen addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>The interim government will remain in power _______ elections can be held. <em>(arra az id\u0151re, am\u00edg \/ addig az id\u0151pontig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>He vowed to search for her _______ he drew his last breath. <em>(am\u00edg csak \/ eg\u00e9szen addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">am\u00edg \/ addig, am\u00edg \/ mindaddig, am\u00edg<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"