We need to fix the leaky _______ before it causes more damage.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 indoor _______ = belt\u00e9ri v\u00edzvezet\u00e9k-rendszer (pl. The house was old and lacked modern indoor _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 emergency _______ = s\u00fcrg\u0151ss\u00e9gi v\u00edzvezet\u00e9k-szerel\u00e9s (pl. He offers 24-hour emergency _______ services.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 do the _______ = elv\u00e9gezni a v\u00edzvezet\u00e9k-szerel\u00e9st (pl. They hired a professional to do the _______ for their new kitchen.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>plumbing<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>plumbing<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: plumbing system \/ plumbing problems \/ plumbing fixtures \/ plumbing work<\/span><\/p><p>similar: pipework \/ piping \/ drainage system \/ water system<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: dryness \/ dehydration \/ aridity<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"plumbing","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T07:51:56+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-21T23:32:46+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-13","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-30T07:50:00+00:00"},{"id":51263,"front":"<p>We need to _______ the damage caused by the storm before we can start repairs. <em>(felm\u00e9rni \/ meg\u00edt\u00e9lni)<\/em><\/p><p>The teacher will _______ the students&#039; progress based on their final exams and coursework. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kelni \/ min\u0151s\u00edteni)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers aim to _______ the effectiveness of the new drug through ri