s forgalom (pl. The sidewalk is designed to accommodate heavy _______ traffic.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: pedestrian crossing \/ pedestrian zone \/ pedestrian safety \/ pedestrian traffic<\/span><\/p><p>similar: walker \/ foot traveler \/ on-foot \/ non-motorized<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: vehicle \/ motorist \/ driver<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":2,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-28T07:50:26+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-21T21:25:58+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-04","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-01T10:57:38+00:00"},{"id":51328,"front":"<p>After hours of trying to fix the broken toy, he gave up, realizing his efforts were completely _______. <em>(\u00e9rtelmetlen \/ hi\u00e1baval\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The philosopher argued that without a belief in a higher purpose, human existence can seem utterly _______. <em>(c\u00e9ltalan \/ \u00fcres)<\/em><\/p><p>She found the bureaucratic jargon in the report to be so convoluted that much of it was _______ to her. <em>(\u00e9rthetetlen \/ felesleges)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist&#039;s abstract painting, with its random splashes of color, was dismissed by critics as _______. <em>(semmitmond\u00f3 \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9k n\u00e9lk\u00fcli)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e9rtelmetlen \/ c\u00e9ltalan \/ hi\u00e1baval\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><sp